    "cube_dynamic_friction": 5.0,
    "cube_static_friction": 8.0,
    "comment_cube_friction": "名字含 Cube 的场景盒（桌面等）摩擦。与夹爪分开：桌上爬→保持大；夹爪低摩擦不会把桌面一起带滑。",
    "base_dynamic_friction": 1.5,
    "base_static_friction": 2.0,
    "gripper_collider_layer_group": 1,
    "cloth_collision_exclude_logical": "",
    "comment": "ClothRobot：场景刚体为布-刚代理盒；刚-刚碰撞在 MuJoCo，XPBD 用 Layer_1_No1 禁刚-刚"
